  "notes": {
    "fabin-gurung": "Downloaded v0.9 WORKING source package and checked ZIP contents. It has local formatting and does not load the canonical shared style. It needs a separately validated template migration; existing PDF is not certified against the latest tower.",
    "saugat-paneru": "Live stable CURRENT_CHECKPOINT readback identifies M4 S03, 115-page print proof, PDF 1QLnRQrXQm9Y_gqrCLzcEjkht6MlXIkjk; source ZIP 1cZSTfvecU3Gv29SxHVNbOyWBQbELY6Wa. Earlier M3-current statements below are historical. M4.1 and M4.2 remain separate draft PRs #61/#66. Recovered M4.2 source ZIP SHA256 8e7427b961a5e021d166cb45fd4840b984379f1d45dc6c8ef6e0a550141d3d98 and PDF SHA256 81cebc8f0fffbaa6d7f76f21012b183353832297aa09e4be39c8fa4f6fb6eb67 match the existing audit. M4.2 includes the exact live shared style bytes, but its 114-page PDF uses a fallback font and is not the production CURRENT.",
    "nabin-bista": "Downloaded and opened LATEX_SEQ056 complete source ZIP, SHA256 0b858d405109dc3e5888578bcbe646ec99d0ecdf70a20430fcee07c7079a2fc5. Its main.tex has local formatting and does not load pumlsc-shared. SEQ056 is the latest separately compiled release recorded in Git, not a new promotion of the historical stable CURRENT. The 057 dry-run candidate is not allocated. Full template migration and candidate PDF regression are still required.",
    "binay-karki": "R10.1 is the registered controlled working release; R10.2 is a separate preview, not an automatic CURRENT replacement. Source metadata and release locations were inspected. Exact shared-template inheritance and rendered compliance of these releases remain to be established from a complete verified package. Do not treat a metadata read or a GEE code change as executed science.",
    "shisheer-kc": "Downloaded CKPT14 source ZIP, SHA256 3db3c57a313f43b64c0ac2a19959d41969730e1b48e70a2d3c46fb9bcc172b7f. It uses a project-local pu_fst_thesis style rather than the canonical shared style. CKPT15 phase 4 remains a separately registered candidate. Reconcile that candidate and current scope before migration. CKPT labels are not verified Git LaTeX sequence numbers.",
    "anil-neupane": "Downloaded R2.3 source ZIP, SHA256 ae5c59ddbfc490c32c9db0701797296ffbd14414f3e8192c92111c89e3894458. It does not load the shared pumlsc-shared style. R2.3 remains a researcher review candidate; R2.1 QA is historical supporting evidence, not certification against today's controls. Formatting migration must preserve equations, numerical values, citations and scientific uncertainty.",
    "sunil-rana": "The registered active source is DOCX-first v0.1, with a separately registered candidate DOCX and scientific audit/researcher-action PDFs. No admitted buildable LaTeX project or compiled LaTeX PDF was established. Apply current semantic rules to any new authoring, but do not claim a LaTeX migration or completed NLTHA results from enrollment.",
    "safal-dawadi": "Downloaded v1.12 source ZIP, SHA256 b6330b91e12b5a4b0038a6caf9ad2020c4621d144cf47c0d8cec55d027a6b9bb. It loads the shared style but its packaged style bytes differ from current main. It also differs from the Git manuscript scan; zero flags in this ZIP does not erase the 49 advisory flags in the previously scanned Git source. Reconcile the owner-specific source baseline and private photos before rebuilding; scientific acceptance remains separate."
  },
